name xstest-completions
# The readme: "model_completions / Model completions on XSTest". The columns' names are the files' own: id, type,
# prompt, completion, annotation_1, annotation_2, agreement, final_label. A file is one model's completions: what it
# says of a prompt is said within the file, of the prompt as that model completed it. The two annotation columns are
# each an annotator, and its field what that annotator says of it.
match model_completions/xstest_v2_completions_*.csv
grammar table
separator ,
header
quoted

claims
subject in prompt
subject-kind {name}
attest id type completion agreement final_label
voices annotation_1 annotation_2
